{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1622180,\"title\":\"Deep Hallows - A Brazilian Gothic Fable\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The small town of Furnas Fundas hides a secret far older than its pastures, forests, or the people who live there. During a heated election marred by scandals, Bartira, known merely as the town drunk, unexpectedly finds herself at the center of it all. It’s up to her to face a dark force that has returned to turn the town into a true bloodbath.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h37jOsDLNMG7RhSXiQse4oGGqgH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lK0fdkdgrH7ZZb9NarnnPs5M4nh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":117,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BR\",\"name\":\"Brazil\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Beto Marquez\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5001304,\"name\":\"Beto Marquez\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3485426,\"name\":\"Gabriela Dias\",\"character\":\"Bartira\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k1Dha25ehHc3VCyVTK3OpkmoiJj.jpg\"},{\"id\":583445,\"name\":\"Eriberto Leão\",\"character\":\"Kesabel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lowsAGgm3MKviYCdFPa0uTLBo7J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1355764,\"name\":\"Elisa Volpatto\",\"character\":\"Lilith\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5yYyphskB3VJxGsGP9sc4FCBlyq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1337865,\"name\":\"Johnnas Oliva\",\"character\":\"Luan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eQxgr68zZAISQCOZW4yq9WTIVD4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046025,\"name\":\"Otávio Müller\",\"character\":\"Prefeito Marcão\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u9L0hz1lyawFAU7cDaThhRADrWN.jpg\"},{\"id\":592370,\"name\":\"Rodrigo Pandolfo\",\"character\":\"Rolando\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2G09Q53OjMkabmNxaN2Cz8Kmvqy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1759957,\"name\":\"Wilson Rabelo\",\"character\":\"Padre J