ew\":\"The \\\"true\\\" story of what really became of Elvis Presley. We find Elvis as an elderly resident in an East Texas rest home, who switched identities with an Elvis impersonator years before his \\\"death,\\\" then missed his chance to switch back. He must team up with JFK and fight an ancient Egyptian mummy for the souls of their fellow residents.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062084,\"title\":\"Lesbian Dracula Submarine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pLh8MYW9fB5oUhBmhg6iNjoUiIL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1931, a ragtag group of goofballs must face Contessa Dracula, a seductive sapphic pseudo-fascist who lives on a magical submarine.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22536,\"title\":\"Thirst\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sBnFQwOcmL3dAIYfiQ9nLvLSW7B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9IMZqBKbALO7d2bwr6ECKP4igoe.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A respected priest volunteers for an experimental procedure that may lead to a cure for a deadly virus. He gets infected and dies, but a blood transfusion of unknown origin brings him back to life. Now, he’s torn between faith and bloodlust, and has a newfound desire for the wife of a childhood friend.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22681,\"title\":\"Homecoming\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ALPTyUklWtULWAzaf0J9vrRfUN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mOWeZlcpdAraOSA3ReYWqu2JJt7.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A jilted ex-girlfriend plots revenge after her former beau comes back to their hometown with a new lover.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21910,\"title\":\"I Sell the Dead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Kj